2 CONC ender, May 18, 1855. She was born June 15, 1831, in Roane County, Tenn. Died January 27, 1905, and was interred at Bell Springs, Texas. Rufus Rutherford lived for five years, in the old I. T. Lenoir residence, until he moved to Texas, in 1877. He w
2 CONC as a farmer and was a member of the Cumberland Presbyterian Church. Served in the Confederate army, until the close of the war, as a member of Captain W. L. Clark's company, 2nd Tennessee Calvary. He is now a farmer and banker at Hillsboro, Texas
