2 TITL deed-record-book
1 _OID d3abce73-c3ba-4505-9fbb-bdca954df2d9
1 _DSCR John Arthur, Sr. was born about 1710 in Cullybacky, County Aurain, Ireland. he purchased property from William Hargrove on 9 Sept 1734 in Caroline Co, Va.(32) John Arther and Rebecca his wife, acknowledged their deed indented to John Bowcock (33)
2 CONC . Her purchased 100 ac. on 17 Apr 1756 in Bedford Co, VA. Deed: John Mackey and Magarete, his wife, sold to John Arther of Bedford county, Parish of Russell, 100 ac. of land on Goose Creek. (34)
2 CONT 
2 CONT 
2 CONT He signed a will on 9 Jan 1778 in Bedord Co, Va. Sons: Thomas, Barnabas. Daughters: Mary Dixon, Isabella Mitcham, Sarah Newman, Betty Green. Executors: Thomas Arthur, his son and Nimrod Newman.(35) His taxes were assessed 1782 in Bedford Co, VA.(36
2 CONC ) He died before 28 Jan 1793 in Bedford Co, VA. His estate was probated on 28 Jan 1793 in Bedord Co, VA.(37)  Inventory and Appraisal records on 22 July 1793 in Bedord Co, VA.(38) He was married to Betsy (Rebecca Adams about 1727 in Middlesex Co, V
2 CONC A.
2 CONT 
